Package: libclamprocessing0-dev
Version: 0.8-1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.3.2), libstdc++5 (>= 1:3.3.5), libgcc1 (>= 1:4.0), sfftw2 (>= 2.1.3), libclamcore0-dev (>= 0.8)
Maintainer: CLAM development team <clam@iua.upf.es>
Description: clam framework processing algorithms repository
 libclamprocessing0-dev bundles a substantial number
 of audio and music digital signal processing algorithms
 encapsulated as CLAM Processing objects.
